SUMMARY:Abhivyakti - An Evening of Kathak
DESCRIPTION:Naad. Bhaav. Ūrja. \nThis solo performance moves through the many dimensions of Kathak\, weaving intricate laya and taal\, evocative abhinaya\, and spontaneous dialogue with music. A rare presentation\, seldom encountered in contemporary performance\, is the Ninda Stuti\, exploring the playful\, intimate relationship between Shiva and Parvati. \nThe repertoire features traditional Kathak compositions alongside thoughtfully curated interpretations that highlight the richness and versatility of the form. Apart from the technical virtuosity\, the evening invites audiences into the living spirit of Kathak\, its depth\, authenticity\, and enduring relevance. \nIn collaboration with: \n \nSupported by: \n \n  \nVenue: Auditorium\n\n\nA Journey Through Rhythm and Storytelling\nRSVPs closed. Thank you for your interest\n*Performer*: Amruta Paranjape\n*Event Categories*: Dance\, Performing Arts
URL:https://bangaloreinternationalcentre.org/event/abhivyakti-an-evening-of-kathak/
LOCATION:Bangalore International Centre\, 7\, 4th Main Road\, Domlur II Stage\, Bangalore\, Karnataka\, 560071\, India
CATEGORIES:Dance,Performing Arts
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://bangaloreinternationalcentre.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Thumbnail-2.jpg
END:VEVENT
